<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="legal">
    <h1>Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Last updated: 19 October 2026</strong></p>
    <p><%= settings.siteName %> provides a digital subscription for driver productivity software. Please review this policy before making a payment.</p>

    <h2>Free trial first</h2>
    <p>Every new account receives a free trial counted in rides. We encourage drivers to test all filtering rules and verify phone compatibility before purchasing any paid plan.</p>

    <h2>Paid plans</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Plans are digital software licenses, activated on your mobile number once the payment is confirmed — our Delivery &amp; Activation page gives the times. Current plans and prices are published on our Pricing page.</li>
      <li>A plan is usable the moment it starts, so a started plan is not refunded for a change of mind. The free trial is there so you can decide before paying.</li>
      <li><strong>Charged but no plan, or charged twice:</strong> contact us within 7 days with your transaction reference. A verified unactivated or duplicate payment is refunded in full.</li>
      <li><strong><%= settings.siteName %> does not work on your phone:</strong> if our support team cannot make it work within 7 days of you telling us, we refund the unused part of your plan.</li>
      <li><strong>How refunds are paid:</strong> to the original payment method — the bank account or UPI ID the money came from — within 7 working days of the refund being approved.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cancellation</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>There is no automatic recurring billing and no saved card requirement. Each plan is a one-time prepaid purchase that simply concludes when its duration expires.</li>
      <li>You may cease using <%= settings.siteName %> at any time without cancellation penalties.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Things outside our control</h2>
    <p><%= settings.siteName %> carries out the filtering rules you set, on your own phone. Ride platforms operate independently of us: changes they make to their apps or their terms, shifts in passenger demand, and decisions they take about driver accounts are outside our control and are not grounds for a refund of your <%= settings.siteName %> plan. Section 2 of our Terms sets this out before you buy.</p>

    <h2>Reaching us</h2>
    <p>Keep your payment reference (Order ID or UPI Transaction ID) and contact our support team at <a href="mailto:<%= settings.contactEmail %>"><%= settings.contactEmail %></a> or via the Help section in the app. We respond to all billing inquiries within 2 business days.</p>

    <h2>Who runs <%= settings.siteName %></h2>
    <p><%= settings.siteName %> is owned and operated by its founder, <strong><%= settings.ownerName %></strong> (<%= settings.legalBusinessName %>).</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Email: <a href="mailto:<%= settings.contactEmail %>"><%= settings.contactEmail %></a></li>
      <li>Address: <%= settings.officeAddress %></li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Grievance officer</h3>
    <p><strong><%= settings.grievanceOfficer %></strong> — <a href="mailto:<%= settings.contactEmail %>"><%= settings.contactEmail %></a>.<br>
    Complaints about the app or about your data are acknowledged within 24 hours and resolved within 15 days.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
